judged.lens:
Buildability and compliance. I re-ran both validators in each candidate folder and AST-diffed every top-level function and assignment against the originals in C:\Users\lsire\autocad-mcp. Beyond the validators I checked:
- wall stacking FF over GF, using the fabric() differences;
- spans, stair geometry and void, annex and setbacks;
- where external_steps() lands relative to the pool, porch, house and annex.

I also ran the COM-free villa_dbc.py, which reads dubai_villa_rules.json (146 rules), against each candidate. For reference, the original scores 10 FATAL / 3 MAJOR on villa_dbc.py. The rules file appeared at 01:55, after A (01:12) and C (01:20) had finished, so only B could use it. Scores are nonetheless on outcome.

I viewed all six preview PNGs. I did not use COM at any point.

strengths:
Annex (16800-24000 x 24700-29000) meets the encoded rules:
- 1550 mm from the villa;
- 4750 high;
- 31.0 m2, which is 10% of GA;
- on the N and E boundaries;
- every opening faces south into the site, none in a boundary wall.

problems:
Inherited, not fixed:
- 1200 deck includes the coping (K-POOL-09: 59% of the deck ring missing);
- pool depth 1.4 m (K-POOL-03);
- no POOL_BARRIER or GUARDS declared.

strengths:
Annex (0-9400 x 25550-29000) meets both villa_design and villa_dbc:
- 1550 mm from the villa;
- 4750 high;
- 10% of GA;
- on the N and W boundaries;
- doors and window all face south.

problems:
Four fin arrays stand in the 3 m side setbacks (K-SB-05, K-PRJ-03, K-PRJ-04):
- west x 2300-2750 over 11700-16680;
- a hung FF-only array at x 2300-2750 over 18800-23500, starting at z 4500 and bracketed off the slab;
- a free-standing 3-fin screen at x 1500-1780, only 1.5 m from the boundary;
- a new full-height east array at x 21250-21700 over 11700-22900.

strengths:
Annex (16500-24000 x 2200-8200):
- 2800 mm from the villa;
- AX_FL 850, i.e. 150 above the +700 garden per ground_at;
- top at 5450, under 5500;
- on the east boundary;
- openings face north into the service yard.
The 10.4 m2 plant room sits about 2 m from the balance tank.

grafts:
