- turn the dirty-kitchen service flight along the facade, or move that door, so no step lands in the 7.2 m porch and two 3.0 m DBC bays stay clear;
- widen door openings to 1015 and 810 to beat villa_dbc's 100 mm frame allowance;
- declare FORMAL DINING's south window in FIXED_GLAZING or raise its sill to 1200;
